ull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115741","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115741.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115741.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-18T16:46:37Z"},"body":"There are two `EmitSignal()` overloads:\r\n- `public Error EmitSignal(StringName signal, params Variant[] @args)`\r\n- `public Error EmitSignal(StringName signal, ReadOnlySpan<Variant> @args)` (added in #96329 by DE-YU)\r\n\r\nCalling the first one (using `params`) is not ideal since it allocates an array (unless no arguments passed). Calling the second one allows a stack-allocated span. Using `[]` allows the second one to be called, which is prioritised by C#.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115741/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115741/timeline","